<<!DOCTYPE type=`memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki` spec=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/memetic-wikitext`>>

<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.recovery.shows`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "show a face's prefix and its recovery contact set"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.recovery.shows", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.recovery.shows"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.recovery.shows"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.recovery.shows ~ one face's recovery contacts

`lares persona recovery-contact show <index>` prints the face's prefix and its enrolled recovery contact set.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ show

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`show` params=`index/1 ~ the set of face h1`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ index

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`index` params=`takes/handle-index needs/required seat/1 as/<index> ~ the face's handle index, a whole number from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat-or-hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat-or-hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads the face's own key event log`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.recovery.shows index/1]] ~ the index reads out of range`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ shown

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`shown` params=`exit/0 ~ the prefix and its set`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares persona recovery-contact show

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares persona recovery-contact show]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/edges`>>

!! edges ~ affordance · persona-policy

<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance`>>
<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/persona-policy`>>

